<h2>Website Verification Rejected</h2>

<p>Hello {{ownerName}},</p>

<p>We reviewed your website verification request, but we were unable to approve it at this time.</p>

<p>
  Website: {{websiteName}}<br />
  Website URL: <a href='{{websiteUrl}}'>{{websiteUrl}}</a>
</p>

<p>
  Rejection Reason:<br />
  {{rejectionReason}}
</p>

{{#if manualReviewNotes}}
